---
/** "Serving ..." line with a map pin for the closing banner. */
---

<p class="svc-area">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>
  <span>Serving South Bend, Mishawaka, Elkhart and surrounding Michiana communities.</span>
</p>

<style>
  .svc-area { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; max-width: 300px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #c7cdd3; }
  .svc-area svg { width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; flex: none; margin-top: 0.15rem; color: var(--color-accent-light); }
</style>
